{"4240760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Peasant or Rebel?", "steam_appid": 4240760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun Asymmetrical Party Game for Up to 5 Players!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the peasants survive the Lord’s hunt, or will he stop the revolt before it begins? Find, chase, and outsmart your opponents in this chaotic medieval party game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a medieval peasant, fed up with the Lord’s tyranny. Together with other peasants, you plan a secret nighttime revolt to finally win your freedom. But someone slipped up, and now the Lord is on the hunt. The revolt won’t start without its leaders - can you survive long enough to lead it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240760/extras/2503518984e25713a0a7fd8d05be38e5.avif?t=1773849992\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How To Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As The Lord</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Lord, your goal is to find and eliminate Rebels hiding among your loyal Peasants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch carefully for nervous behavior - Rebels might fart, slip, or try to run and jump away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240760/extras/e4467197b1580723d8ebbdaf19407a4e.poster.avif?t=1773849992\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240760/extras/e4467197b1580723d8ebbdaf19407a4e.webm?t=1773849992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240760/extras/e4467197b1580723d8ebbdaf19407a4e.mp4?t=1773849992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>As a Rebel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Rebel, your goal is to survive and outsmart the Lord. Hide, run, and use animals and interactive objects to your advantage. Be careful - every noisy fart, slip, or encounter with dung and chickens could give you away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240760/extras/c3b690bb95ae47232e8bfcd84590be99.poster.avif?t=1773849992\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240760/extras/c3b690bb95ae47232e8bfcd84590be99.webm?t=1773849992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240760/extras/c3b690bb95ae47232e8bfcd84590be99.mp4?t=1773849992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Hide-and-Seek Action: </strong>Play as the Lord hunting peasants, or as peasants trying to outsmart him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Ragdoll Physics: </strong>Enjoy chaotic fights with hilarious ragdoll reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Stylized Graphics: </strong>A medieval world full of character and charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with Friends or Online: </strong>Invite your friends or find games online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of Interactive Objects:</strong> Hitch a ride on animals, dodge dung, and sneak past chickens without blowing your cover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Fun &amp; Chaos:</strong> Laughter, tense moments, and unforgettable plays every round!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun Asymmetrical Party Game for Up to 5 Players!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the peasants survive the Lord’s hunt, or will he stop the revolt before it begins? Find, chase, and outsmart your opponents in this chaotic medieval party game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a medieval peasant, fed up with the Lord’s tyranny. Together with other peasants, you plan a secret nighttime revolt to finally win your freedom. But someone slipped up, and now the Lord is on the hunt. The revolt won’t start without its leaders - can you survive long enough to lead it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240760/extras/2503518984e25713a0a7fd8d05be38e5.avif?t=1773849992\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How To Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As The Lord</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Lord, your goal is to find and eliminate Rebels hiding among your loyal Peasants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch carefully for nervous behavior - Rebels might fart, slip, or try to run and jump away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240760/extras/e4467197b1580723d8ebbdaf19407a4e.poster.avif?t=1773849992\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240760/extras/e4467197b1580723d8ebbdaf19407a4e.webm?t=1773849992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240760/extras/e4467197b1580723d8ebbdaf19407a4e.mp4?t=1773849992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_para